        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 6\" x 16\" Stainless Steel Door Push Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n6\" wide x 16\" high commercial door push plate. Primarily used in restaurants, warehouses, factories and stores. Made of .050\" thick high quality solid stainless steel for longevity. Packaged with stainless mounting screws for easy installation. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/4-x-16-stainless-steel-push-plate\"><b>Stainless Steel 4\" x 16\" Push Plate</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/8-x-16-stainless-steel-push-plate\"><b>Extra Wide 8\" x 16\" Push Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese commercial push plates are made in the USA by Don-Jo Mfg.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Don-Jo 72-630 Stainless Steel Push Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 16\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: .050\" (1.2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Packaged With Mounting Screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
